<div class="container">
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div>
  <h1>About Berlin Studio Map</h1>
  <p>Berlin Studio Map is a free directory of photography studios for hire across the city, built for photographers and producers who are tired of trawling separate listing sites to compare studios.</p>
  <p>It consolidates studio information in one searchable, filterable place, so you can compare daylight, infinity coves, blackout, drive-in access, and facilities like kitchens and makeup rooms side by side, on a map.</p>

  <h2>Data &amp; Accuracy</h2>
  <p>Information comes from studio websites and public listings. This directory is a new, early-stage project: every studio on it is currently marked "estimated" until we've verified details directly with the studio. If you run one of these studios and something is wrong, or missing, please get in touch and we'll fix it.</p>

  <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
  <p>Studio suggestions, corrections, and feedback: <a href="mailto:hello@berlinstudiomaps.com">hello@berlinstudiomaps.com</a></p>
</div>
</PageLayout>
